# The joint table of the joint certificate: kernel check, part 6

Witnesses for the checker `CollatzPosDens.jointCertYCheckAt` of the joint table, and the
kernel evaluation of the checker against them, for the following entries:

* level `2`, positions `3385` to `5503`.
* level `1`, positions `0` to `117`.

Each witness of an entry is the list of the numbers `10^4 a + p'` of its nonzero terms, in
increasing order of the letter `a`.

## Main definitions

* `CollatzPosDens.jointCertYWit2_3385_3915`: the witnesses of level `2`, positions `3385` to
  `3914`.
* `CollatzPosDens.jointCertYWit2_3915_4445`: the witnesses of level `2`, positions `3915` to
  `4444`.
* `CollatzPosDens.jointCertYWit2_4445_4975`: the witnesses of level `2`, positions `4445` to
  `4974`.
* `CollatzPosDens.jointCertYWit2_4975_5504`: the witnesses of level `2`, positions `4975` to
  `5503`.
* `CollatzPosDens.jointCertYWit1_0`: the witnesses of level `1`, positions `0` to `117`.

## Main results

* `CollatzPosDens.jointCertYLevelOK_2_3385`: the entries of level `2`, positions `3385` to `5503`,
  pass the check.
* `CollatzPosDens.jointCertYLevelOK_1_0`: the entries of level `1`, positions `0` to `117`, pass
  the check.

